  "decision_conditions": [
    "Reason : 1 - The advertisements by reason of their scale, location and method of illumination, detract from the character and appearance of the conservation area, and the setting of the listed building. It fails to respond sensitively to the historic setting and, importantly, the building frontage as a whole. The advertisements harm the visual amenity of the area, and harm the significance of the conservation area and the listed building, as well as the building itself which is a non-designated heritage asset. The proposal conflicts with policies D1 (design), D2 (Heritage), D3 (Shopfronts) and D4 (Advertisements) of the Camden Local Plan 2017, the London Plan 2021, and the NPPF."
